/*
 * Implements semantic validation for static field access on enum types
 * using the path operator `::`.
 *
 * Supported static accesses:
 *   - Enum :: VariantName     — access a specific enum variant
 *   - Enum :: _members_       — access an array of all enum variants
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::path::enum_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/path/enum_.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-25
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
